      Si     10.8620000000    10.8620000000    10.8620000000
      Si     12.2197500000    12.2197500000    12.2197500000
    &END COORD
    &KIND Si
      BASIS_SET DZVP-MOLOPT-SR-GTH
      BASIS_SET AUX_FIT cpFIT3
      POTENTIAL GTH-PBE
    &END KIND
  &END SUBSYS
&END FORCE_EVAL
